{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/WishList_2.gif?t=1747147623\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/Be_part_of_Amer\u2019s_family!.png?t=1747147623\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your character and step into Amer's world, where family drama and friend rivalries turn into endless fights! Whether you\u2019re teaming up or going head-to-head, get ready for a chaotic adventure full of unexpected twists, hilarious moments, and endless fun!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/Steam_7.gif?t=1747147623\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/Steam_4_1.gif?t=1747147623\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/Unleash_your_anger.png?t=1747147623\" />Settle family fights and arguments by teaming up with each other and becoming an unstoppable power team, fighting your way to victory and showing them who\u2019s really in charge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/Sized_Frame_1.gif?t=1747147623\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/Steam_5.gif?t=1747147623\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/Choose_your_map.png?t=1747147623\" />Get ready for the ultimate family fighting game! Choose from a variety of exciting maps, each with its own unique theme and challenges, for an unforgettable experience filled with fun, chaos, and friendly competition for everyone to enjoy.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/Steam_3.gif?t=1747147623\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/Win_with_ease.png?t=1747147623\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take the lead and change the course of the match with one smart move, TRAPS! Whether you're setting a sneaky surprise around the next corner or luring your opponents right where you want them, using traps at just the right moment can give you the upper hand. Outsmart the competition, watch the chaos unfold, and claim your victory with ease!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/extras/Steam_2_1.gif?t=1747147623\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3264920?t=1747147623","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747147623","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/344013a643ca0e7ddf02c6ae42a52037e03519a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747147623","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264920/344013a643ca0e7ddf02c6ae42a52037e03519a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747147623","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Shari